cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below (attribution is required)."
title: "A projective plane of order 18 admits no collineation of order 17 (computer-assisted; not peer reviewed)"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: "Kobayashi"
    given-names: "Yudai"
    alias: "yudaikobayashi"
abstract: "A proof that a projective plane of order 18 has no collineation of order 17. The homology case is excluded by a norm-parity argument; the triangle case is reduced to a finite problem and settled by a computer search. Derivations, programs and verification were mostly done by AI (Claude, Anthropic) under the author's direction. Not peer reviewed."
date-released: 2026-10-17
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
keywords:
  - projective plane
  - collineation
  - order 18
